10 scores) is the position of the second largest of the ten inputs (95.3% agreement, the rest are near-ties).
The state after step 1 is exactly 2-dimensional: h1 = pos1*max(W_x,0) + neg1*max(-W_x,0) with pos1 = x1^+,
neg1 = x1^-. Units 0,2,3,5,9..15 have almost no input weight and only integrate; units 4 and 1,6,7,8 have
large input weights of opposite sign, so the state is driven by |x_t| through those two groups.
